@page "/privacy"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    ViewData["Nav"] = "privacy";
}
<h1 class="title">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Last updated: October 2026 &middot; ELX11 Community</p>

<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
        At <strong>ELX11</strong>, we value and respect your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what limited information we collect when you use our website and connect to our online game servers, how it is used, and how your data is protected.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We believe in minimal data collection. We only collect information strictly required to authenticate players and run online multiplayer:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Your chosen Game ID (username) and a secure cryptographic hash of your password. We never have access to or store your plaintext password.</li>
        <li><strong>Gameplay & Match Data:</strong> In-game player nicknames, division rating, match records (wins, draws, losses, goals scored/conceded), match timestamps, and rankings. This data is displayed publicly on community leaderboards.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical & Connection Logs:</strong> IP addresses and connection timestamps recorded temporarily in server diagnostic logs to facilitate P2P match routing, prevent DDoS attacks, and enforce anti-ban rules.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>The collected information is used solely to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Authenticate your game client and permit access to online multiplayer lobbies.</li>
        <li>Calculate player rankings, divisions, competitive standings, and match statistics.</li>
        <li>Ensure fair play, monitor against unauthorized exploits, and maintain server integrity.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">4. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
    <p>
        We <strong>do not sell, rent, monetize, or disclose</strong> your personal data to any commercial advertisers, third parties, or marketing agencies. 
        We do not employ third-party behavioral trackers or external tracking cookies.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">5. Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
    <p>
        Our website uses only essential, strictly functional cookies (such as session authentication cookies for administrator access). We do not use advertising or third-party tracking cookies.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="panel" style="padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">6. Your Rights & Data Deletion</h2>
    <p>
        You have the right to request deletion of your account and associated gameplay statistics at any time. If you wish to have your account removed from the ELX11 database, please contact the server administration.
    </p>
</section>
